# Mosquitto ACL. Devices never see each other's traffic (hub-and-spoke).
#
# The hub's service account (HUB_MQTT_USERNAME, default "hub") can do anything.
user hub
topic readwrite #

# Every other account is a device whose USERNAME == device_id (%u).
# A device may only publish its own events and status, and only read its own
# commands plus the hub's presence.
pattern write hub/%u/event/+
pattern read device/%u/cmd/+
pattern readwrite device/%u/status
# Shared topic: Mosquitto warns that it has no %u/%c. That is intended.
pattern read hub/status
